  "bodyHash": "b880e23ccf58fa49",
  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<h1>模组需求（重要）</h1>\n<h4><strong>本模组需要以下前置模组：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-immersive-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Armorer</a> (TACZ 武器包)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Tacz Integration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Armorer</a>（可选 TACZ 武器包，如需制作 Create 枪械）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您不知道如何安装 TACZ 武器包，请参阅 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Tacz Integration</a> 中的安装教程。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_0c80647f-43e3-48ee-bce9-f81d45f49717.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组为 Create Immersive Tacz Integration 添加了新的部件和配方，以包含沉浸式军械库的配方。</p>\n<h1><strong>全新枪械配方！</strong></h1>\n<p>由于 TaCZ 武器相比原版 Minecraft 和 Create 的武器非常强大，因此已使用新枪械部件对配方进行了平衡调整。现在您将需要精密机械装置和机械工匠等组件才能制作它们。</p>\n<h2><strong>全新“螺线管”导轨手枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_21b1cea6-8b0f-4410-b0e9-eb3038912252.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“激发式”自动导轨手枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_1bc52c00-3099-4d0d-85a8-a58427049268.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“制动”左轮手枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_11a87dbe-1008-4a70-820e-b023b8516e0c.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“传奇”手枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_118555e5-5ac2-4aaf-accb-aeae3ef2ceea.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“覆写”电磁炮配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_782b3daa-3aef-4827-ae21-fd021ef26454.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“推力反转”突击步枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_3bba4652-f3cb-46dc-853e-34e12aec169f.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“消音”霰弹枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_1ce472ed-8435-4e16-99f1-7b63227cf064.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“压合”双管霰弹枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_b1e6d9c3-40e1-46b1-ba48-dd648f51a4ad.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“伺服电路”导轨冲锋枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_14e19f6f-b9f1-40cb-ac23-1894108bbf6b.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“蜂鸟”微型冲锋枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_40047fed-972f-4808-8efc-7101bbef5183.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“净化器”化学喷射器配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_12bfac32-d653-4898-a32f-4c81eeb15482.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“熔炉”等离子枪配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_204859d9-0a52-483f-b300-142bdb5e38fc.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>全新“火神”双管加农炮配方</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_f6f00fbc-4ff9-4692-9dad-efa60725fd7e.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<h1><strong>全新弹壳！</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>弹壳</strong>通过锯切黄铜板制成。您可以使用 JEI 在锯床上设置过滤器，选择您需要的弹壳类型，使其将板材切割为该类型。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_536d70d5-a54a-46bd-aceb-57d92d434afe.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1><strong>全新枪械配件配方！</strong></h1>\n<p>一把完整的枪械离不开各种<strong>配件</strong>，以下是一些示例：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_ccb1e2a4-c984-450a-9dfb-c30ac7734fdd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_90a94294-a3e9-4981-9a08-c9b18da1d534.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_b22d4e46-b118-415b-a6c1-f82aa5f02355.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_34c7f6ff-e46d-4c66-945c-51c900ba2f5b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_6d4ecfbc-5df9-4e77-8dfb-41f353e471d1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_add67988-b925-44bd-9679-0ad8cda7303b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_5acb2411-649e-4cd3-881c-d29cd4d52141.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_219c3922-1a1b-4bab-b7e8-11f20371f45f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_05173650-4705-4e35-b18f-af864f660501.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如需更多信息，请访问 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Tacz Integration</a> 页面。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>常见问题 (FAQ)</h1>\n<p>问：启动游戏时出现错误。</p>\n<p>答：尝试将 Forge 更新到最新版本。</p>\n<p>问：使用锯床时制作出了其他物品。</p>\n<p>答：这意味着有其他模组存在相同配方。请在锯床上使用过滤器，使其仅输出您需要的物品。</p>\n<p>本模组主要为个人使用而制作，但如果您有任何修改建议，欢迎在评论区提出！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>查看我的其他模组！</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-mechanical-companion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264989/description_609b037b-78cb-4497-8b4f-c95c77def773.png\" alt=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3eebc495-7c50-4bec-9c5b-43b13ec09ac0.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>想要报告漏洞、分享评测、提出功能建议或获取游戏更新？加入我们的官方 Discord 频道！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jWqsA8EPeC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_4336ae1a-a280-4da5-8faa-7588ff631da4.png\" width=\"109\" height=\"109\"></a></p>\n<p>如果您喜欢本模组并希望支持其开发，我们将非常感谢捐赠 ❤️<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmarcosjoestar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264989/description_a58064f4-0c7b-475f-b0f8-83767c242bd8.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
